---
const fees = [
	{ value: "0.025%", label: "Maker fee", note: "0.015% Hyperliquid + 0.01% builder fee, base tier" },
	{ value: "0.055%", label: "Taker fee", note: "0.045% Hyperliquid + 0.01% builder fee, base tier" },
];
---

<section id="fees" class="border-b border-stroke-weaker">
	<div class="reveal mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
		<div class="text-center">
			<span class="text-3xs uppercase tracking-uppercase text-fg-faint">Fees</span>
			<h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-display">Fees start low and go lower.</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 mx-auto max-w-md text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
				Hyperliquid's trading fee plus a flat 0.01% builder fee on perp orders and spot sells. No gas per trade, no subscription, no spread markup.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-12 mx-auto max-w-2xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-stroke-weaker rounded-xs overflow-hidden border border-stroke-weak">
			{fees.map((f) => (
				<div class="bg-surface p-6 md:p-8 text-center">
					<div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium tabular-nums tracking-tight">{f.value}</div>
					<div class="mt-1 text-2xs uppercase tracking-uppercase text-fg-muted">{f.label}</div>
					<div class="mt-1 text-2xs text-fg-faint">{f.note}</div>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>

		<p class="mt-6 text-center text-2xs text-fg-faint">
			Perp rates shown. Hyperliquid's share drops with volume and HYPE staking, to as low as 0% maker /
			0.0144% taker; the 0.01% builder fee stays the same. Spot starts at 0.04% maker / 0.07% taker, with the
			builder fee on sells only; TWAP orders carry no builder fee, and builder-deployed (HIP-3) markets can set
			their own rates.
			<a
				href="https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/fundingComparison"
				rel="noopener"
				class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-fg-muted transition-colors duration-150"
			>
				Funding rates are public and comparable across venues.
			</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
